Subject: [PATCH 1539/1695] dts: stm32: expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33
 agent in stm32mp231.dtsi

Expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33 agent with ID 7.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f08e1f734126d472e31ade26b6d3b97f9eb2033b dts: stm32: expose vdda18adc regulator to CM33 agent in stm32mp231.dtsi]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: If3003ea552d70a4db2c3616c7666905daff22389
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/438061
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp23-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp23-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp23-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
index 115475f63..7f763ffcc 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp23-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp23-st-scmi-cfg.dtsi
@@ -1623,6 +1623,11 @@
 						reg = <VOLTD_SCMI_UCPD>;
 						voltd-supply = <&vdd33ucpd>;
 					};
+
+					regulator@7 {
+						reg = <VOLTD_SCMI_ADC>;
+						voltd-supply = <&vdda18adc>;
+					};
 				};
 			};
 		};
